                                        <h3>How much should an early-stage D2C startup spend on marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>25-30% of revenue at ₹5-15 lakh MRR. Higher at pre-launch / launch. Below 20% typically underinvestment; above 40% is unsustainable.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I hire an agency or freelancers?</h3>
